{"id":"n62302-1-27","stage":1,"title":"잘되다 · 顺利","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62302-1-27-1","ko":"공부는 잘되니?","zh":"学习还顺利吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"공부는","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공부는","audio":"/audio/9b97419fada8f066c750.mp3"}},{"text":"잘되니?","meaning":"好，顺利","explanation":"잘되다：好，顺利；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"잘되다","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62302","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘되니","audio":"/audio/5ec5a41688daca26249a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c9b4aed6d54a8847","term":"공부","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3","entryId":"36672","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부"]},{"id":"2bf32329a9311a6d","term":"잘되다","zh":"好，顺利","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3","entryId":"62302","definition":"某事情或现象的结果好。","pronunciation":["잘되다","잘뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cdfd240a7bb266df767e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62302-1-27-2","ko":"요새 고민이 많아서 공부에 집중이 안 됩니다.","zh":"最近烦恼太多，没法专心学习。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요새","meaning":"近来，日来，最近","explanation":"요새：近来，日来，最近。","readings":[{"term":"요새","audio":"/audio/2e1177912c702a7aa0da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67864","senseId":"1","lemma":"요새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요새","audio":"/audio/2e1177912c702a7aa0da.mp3"}},{"text":"고민이","meaning":"苦闷，苦恼，烦恼","explanation":"고민：苦闷，苦恼，烦恼；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"고민","audio":"/audio/2d27a95090cbb6802399.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19225","senseId":"1","lemma":"고민","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고민이","audio":"/audio/27de724aa258c8af2052.mp3"}},{"te